Hey!

288
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,920
Fine. I give up. I give up.

289
00:15:03,460 --> 00:15:05,280
I won't call you a puppy again.

290
00:15:11,590 --> 00:15:12,720
Feeling better now?

291
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:17,590
Yes.

292
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:21,780
♫What is love, love, love supposed to be?♫

293
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:25,760
♫Can someone teach, teach me
how it should be?♫

294
00:15:25,780 --> 00:15:26,550
Let's get you home.

295
00:15:26,570 --> 00:15:31,270
♫I saw people in love,
so I wanted some love for me♫

296
00:15:31,290 --> 00:15:35,020
♫Wanna love, love, so please help me♫

297
00:15:43,410 --> 00:15:44,560
♫Can you teach me?♫

298
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:47,080
[Chanmit Karaoke]

299
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:54,840
Oh.

300
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:55,800
- 'Kay.
- Here.

301
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,000
Right.

302
00:15:57,650 --> 00:15:58,880
Here's your drink.

303
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,650
Oh.

304
00:16:05,090 --> 00:16:06,280
They're here.

305
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,640
We just finished setting the table.

306
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:09,700
Come and eat.

307
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,320
Here.

308
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:11,750
Come on, come on.

309
00:16:11,770 --> 00:16:13,080
Have a seat.

310
00:16:17,590 --> 00:16:19,640
This one is yours, Kanthi.

311
00:16:19,740 --> 00:16:21,200
Thank you.

312
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:30,360
This one's for you, Gear.

313
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:36,840
This is braised pork leg
from Auntie Daeng

314
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,440
She made it this morning.

315
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:41,400
She knows it's your favorite,
so she brought some over.

316
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,970
And I made this one myself.

317
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:46,810
It's as tasty as always.

318
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:49,010
This looks so good.

319
00:16:55,060 --> 00:16:55,800
Oh?

320
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,200
Why aren't you eating?

321
00:16:58,570 --> 00:17:00,000
Or has Kanthi...

322
00:17:01,330 --> 00:17:02,880
already taken you out for a meal?

323
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,250
Didn't I already tell you

324
00:17:06,369 --> 00:17:09,040
to bring him home for a meal?

325
00:17:09,940 --> 00:17:10,920
I didn't.

326
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:13,160
I only gave him one cookie.

327
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:14,700
Really?

328
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:19,980
You two...

329
00:17:20,099 --> 00:17:21,589
have seen that video, haven't you?

330
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:26,880
I'm really sorry...

331
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,970
I embarrassed you.

332
00:17:31,410 --> 00:17:32,820
Don't worry about it.

333
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:34,500
It'll pass.

334
00:17:35,410 --> 00:17:36,440
Don't worry.

335
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:39,240
We've never felt that way,

336
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:40,200
okay?

337
00:17:43,450 --> 00:17:46,120
But everyone in the neighborhood
already knows.

338
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:01,640
Oh.

339
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,880
Digging in already?

340
00:18:04,050 --> 00:18:05,240
Jeez.

341
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:08,620
I told you to wait for
my sour curry, didn't I?

342
00:18:08,650 --> 00:18:09,950
You were taking too long.

343
00:18:09,970 --> 00:18:10,580
Hey.

344
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:14,860
I had to wait until
the sour curry was ready first.

345
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:18,170
How could I let Auntie Daeng's
braised pork leg beat my curry?

346
00:18:22,410 --> 00:18:23,590
Gear.

347
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:25,960
Eat up, okay?

348
00:18:27,810 --> 00:18:29,680
Try not to think about it.

349
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:33,000
Right.

350
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,760
Enjoy the food, okay?

351
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:37,360
- Thanks.
- No problem.

352
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,680
All the dishes here

353
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:43,040
are from our neighbors.

354
00:18:43,590 --> 00:18:44,920
They brought them over

355
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,880
to show their support for you, Gear.

356
00:18:48,580 --> 00:18:50,260
They've known you since you were little.

357
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:52,980
They know what you're like,

358
00:18:53,770 --> 00:18:55,780
so they would never believe that video.

359
00:18:58,050 --> 00:19:00,180
You're crying again?

360
00:19:00,580 --> 00:19:02,170
Whose grandson are you, I wonder?

361
00:19:02,190 --> 00:19:03,520
You tear up so easily.

362
00:19:08,420 --> 00:19:10,040
Your grandson, of course.

363
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:12,840
Yeah.

364
00:19:13,930 --> 00:19:15,700
With all this support,

365
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:18,600
let's figure out how we'll
finish all the food.

366
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:20,780
- Exactly.
- Come on, come on.

367
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,400
Alright.

368
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,970
- Eat up, okay?
- Let's eat.

369
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:24,680
Come on, what are you waiting for?

370
00:19:26,250 --> 00:19:27,560
Let's dig in.

371
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:32,200
Eat well, alright?

372
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:33,570
Eat up.

373
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:35,970
Look at all the support you've got here.

374
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:36,820
See?

375
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:40,260
[One-day Trip]

376
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:43,980
Right now, we're at 'Talat Noi.'

377
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,140
This is a riverside community
along the Chao Phraya River

378
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,780
that still retains
its traditional Chinese charm.

379
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:52,120
But there are also cool cafés
where we can hang out.

380
00:19:58,060 --> 00:20:00,620
My favorite has to be
the grilled bananas here.

381
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:01,860
They're grilled just right.

382
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:04,640
If you have time,
feel free to visit this community!

383
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:11,610
[inging: Looks very interesting]

384
00:20:11,630 --> 00:20:14,680
[milkzii: Did you go there with Gear?]

385
00:20:21,850 --> 00:20:24,460
[It's Jay: No, I went there alone]

386
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:27,320
[Sabai Smile: Then who was holding the camera?]

387
00:20:28,580 --> 00:20:33,940
[It's Jay: I used a tripod]

388
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,920
What's wrong?

389
00:21:02,170 --> 00:21:03,630
You look like you need to take a dump.

390
00:21:05,630 --> 00:21:06,360
Nothing.

391
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:08,650
Why?

392
00:21:09,130 --> 00:21:11,200
Did your boyfriend tell you to
hide in the closet again?

393
00:21:14,540 --> 00:21:15,310
You can tell us

394
00:21:15,330 --> 00:21:17,080
if something's wrong, Nu.

395
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,440
There's really nothing, man.

396
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:29,020
It's fine if you don't want to talk.

397
00:21:30,170 --> 00:21:31,760
But think about this.

398
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:35,160
Are you really happy right now?

399
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,400
Nu.

400
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:51,880
Love should bring you happiness,
shouldn't it?

401
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:56,200
If you can't honestly say you're happy,

402
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:59,060
then it's not
a healthy relationship, is it?

403
00:22:06,780 --> 00:22:08,120
But I love him.

404
00:22:11,850 --> 00:22:13,120
Does he love you

405
00:22:13,420 --> 00:22:15,020
as much as you love him?

406
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,960
If he does,

407
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:21,680
then why are you the one
sitting here feeling bad all alone?

408
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:30,640
I think...

409
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:33,400
I should get to work.

410
00:22:38,690 --> 00:22:40,400
Zee, wasn't that a bit too harsh?

411
00:22:41,080 --> 00:22:41,700
What?

412
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,460
I did that for your sake.

413
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:45,920
If he really does break up with that guy,

414
00:22:45,940 --> 00:22:47,200
you'll have your chance.

415
00:22:48,520 --> 00:22:49,480
Isn't that a good thing?

416
00:23:00,700 --> 00:23:02,040
Oh, dear.

417
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:03,720
You almost got thrown in jail overseas

418
00:23:03,740 --> 00:23:06,120
all because you were homesick.

419
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:08,360
So how did you handle it, Kanthi?

420
00:23:09,330 --> 00:23:11,340
I had to explain to them, of course,

421
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,420
that what they were smelling

422
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:13,560
wasn't poisonous gas.

423
00:23:13,740 --> 00:23:15,320
I was just making pad kaphrao.

424
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:19,610
Oh, you...

425
00:23:19,630 --> 00:23:20,470
Cheers, cheers.

426
00:23:20,490 --> 00:23:22,680
There was so much smoke, too.

427
00:23:23,220 --> 00:23:24,620
Anyone would be terrified.

428
00:23:24,820 --> 00:23:26,010
How about some mangoes?

429
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,880
They only got drunk together one night,

430
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,780
and they're already this close?

431
00:23:33,890 --> 00:23:36,780
Granddad just gets along
with everyone easily.

432
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:38,220
It's a good thing, though.

433
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:40,360
This puts my mind at ease.

434
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:53,440
Granddad and Grandpa.

435
00:23:53,850 --> 00:23:55,120
- Hello.
- Hi.

436
00:23:55,140 --> 00:23:55,960
Hello.

437
00:23:56,020 --> 00:23:57,320
Mm. Hello.

438
00:24:00,970 --> 00:24:01,610
Oh.

439
00:24:01,630 --> 00:24:02,560
Come on in.

440
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:08,320
Come on. Come inside.

441
00:24:09,210 --> 00:24:10,120
- Alright.
- Right.

442
00:24:11,780 --> 00:24:12,500
Join us.

443
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:15,230
Gear.

444
00:24:15,900 --> 00:24:17,960
How close are you to Mr. Kanthi?

445
00:24:18,830 --> 00:24:20,320
You haven't been keeping us updated?

446
00:24:20,970 --> 00:24:21,680
Yeah.

447
00:24:22,490 --> 00:24:23,880
You said you were done with him.

448
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:27,040
I already gave you two an update, didn't I?

449
00:24:27,580 --> 00:24:28,600
Or else...

450
00:24:28,810 --> 00:24:30,560
I wouldn't have introduced you to him.

451
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:33,280
So you're officially introducing him to us?

452
00:24:33,320 --> 00:24:34,020
Hm?

453
00:24:34,930 --> 00:24:36,030
Wait, hold on.

454
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,490
You're... serious?

455
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,860
But he's a player, though.

456
00:24:45,620 --> 00:24:46,650
I think we should drop it.

457
00:24:47,930 --> 00:24:49,520
Forget Mr. Kanthi,

458
00:24:49,840 --> 00:24:51,240
and let's talk about him.

459
00:24:52,310 --> 00:24:55,280
Do you know that video
of you punching Sand

460
00:24:56,060 --> 00:24:58,320
is all over social media now?

461
00:24:59,240 --> 00:24:59,960
What's your plan?

462
00:25:05,620 --> 00:25:06,720
I don't know.

463
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:08,640
I have no idea.

464
00:25:14,730 --> 00:25:15,830
How about

465
00:25:16,430 --> 00:25:17,840
we get revenge on him?

466
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:20,010
And make sure it really hurts.

467
00:25:22,460 --> 00:25:23,320
How?

468
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:25,790
Here's what we do.

469
00:25:26,610 --> 00:25:27,430
So...

470
00:25:28,410 --> 00:25:30,210
Sand really loves Kim, right?

471
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,720
Then you steal Kim away from him.

472
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,350
Break his heart too.

473
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:39,000
You'll get your boyfriend back

474
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,240
and get your revenge too.

475
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:41,840
Killing two birds with one stone.

476
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:43,430
What soap opera have you been watching,

477
00:25:43,450 --> 00:25:44,060
hm?

478
00:25:44,340 --> 00:25:45,800
It's totally ridiculous.

479
00:25:46,110 --> 00:25:47,010
- Huh?
- What?

480
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:47,800
Damn you.

481
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:49,760
I won't do it.

482
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,780
If I do that,

483
00:25:55,060 --> 00:25:56,440
I'm not that different from him, am I?

484
00:26:07,230 --> 00:26:09,080
Then, how about...

485
00:26:09,810 --> 00:26:12,360
making a video to clear things up?

486
00:26:12,650 --> 00:26:14,970
Then we expose him for
stealing your boyfriend.

487
00:26:15,620 --> 00:26:17,280
That way, people will turn against him.

488
00:26:17,870 --> 00:26:19,280
Hey, I think this is a good idea.

489
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,040
What do you think?

490
00:26:21,890 --> 00:26:22,800
I think it is.

491
00:26:24,310 --> 00:26:24,960
Gosh!

492
00:26:25,580 --> 00:26:26,840
Nothing I suggest works.

493
00:26:27,330 --> 00:26:29,240
I really appreciate you two

494
00:26:29,620 --> 00:26:30,800
looking out for me,

495
00:26:33,390 --> 00:26:34,640
but just let it go.

496
00:26:35,900 --> 00:26:37,350
It'll die down on its own.

497
00:26:39,230 --> 00:26:42,790
Things blow over pretty quickly
on social media these days.

498
00:26:43,490 --> 00:26:46,290
The world might have eyes on me today,

499
00:26:46,830 --> 00:26:48,460
but tomorrow,
a new controversy will come along,

500
00:26:48,690 --> 00:26:49,840
and they'll forget about me.

501
00:26:50,730 --> 00:26:51,920
It's up to you then.

502
00:26:52,910 --> 00:26:53,560
I'm...

503
00:26:54,110 --> 00:26:55,840
I'm so fed up with your kindness.

504
00:26:56,270 --> 00:26:57,880
Hey, let me know when you get ordained.

505
00:26:58,120 --> 00:26:59,620
I'll come collect some of those coins.

506
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:04,700
Honestly...

507
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,920
You don't have to
spend the night here with me.

508
00:27:07,490 --> 00:27:08,600
I'm really fine.

509
00:27:10,090 --> 00:27:11,360
I know you're tough,

510
00:27:11,850 --> 00:27:13,800
but isn't it better to
have friends by your side?

511
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:14,960
Right, Jay?

512
00:27:19,490 --> 00:27:20,330
Damn it, Jay.

513
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,790
Why do you look so troubled? What's wrong?

514
00:27:23,370 --> 00:27:24,280
It's the netizens.

515
00:27:24,410 --> 00:27:26,360
They're going after Gear
like he's killed someone.

516
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,680
I don't feature you
that often on my channel,

517
00:27:29,200 --> 00:27:31,160
but they still come after you
in almost every video.

518
00:27:32,600 --> 00:27:33,760
So fucking annoying.

519
00:27:34,370 --> 00:27:35,520
I'm sorry.

520
00:27:37,080 --> 00:27:38,640
How is that your fault?

521
00:27:39,180 --> 00:27:40,640
It's Sand's fucking fault.

522
00:27:42,390 --> 00:27:43,030
Oh, by the way,

523
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:45,010
be honest with me.

524
00:27:45,950 --> 00:27:47,450
Back then, how come the two of you...

525
00:27:47,470 --> 00:27:48,030
Mm.

526
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,440
ever became friends with him?

527
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,360
I just don't get it.

528
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:00,670
Wait...

529
00:28:01,270 --> 00:28:02,400
That said,

530
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:05,120
some people are taking your side, Gear.

531
00:28:06,150 --> 00:28:07,840
Look at this account.

532
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:09,620
It's "KT" or something.

533
00:28:10,470 --> 00:28:12,440
He's fighting back against
all the hate comments.

534
00:28:13,490 --> 00:28:14,200
Take a look.

535
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:15,880
Show me.

536
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:16,590
Look.

537
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:33,680
Gear...

538
00:28:36,180 --> 00:28:37,320
Is this your fan?

539
00:28:47,620 --> 00:28:49,960
They're insulting his parents, too?!

540
00:28:50,370 --> 00:28:51,640
We'll see about that,

541
00:28:51,850 --> 00:28:53,000
fucking jackass!

542
00:28:53,950 --> 00:28:54,560
Hey.

543
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:55,440
Kanthi.

544
00:28:55,750 --> 00:28:58,000
You've been away from the bar for days.

545
00:28:58,090 --> 00:28:59,520
Now that I get to see you again,

546
00:28:59,740 --> 00:29:01,560
you're just picking fights
with people online?

547
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:04,400
Just tell me what you need my help with.

548
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,390
I need to get back to
looking after the customers.

549
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:08,560
We're already short on waiters today.

550
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,400
Fucking hell!

551
00:29:11,450 --> 00:29:12,600
Was that for me?

552
00:29:13,410 --> 00:29:14,600
I wasn't cursing at you.

553
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:15,880
It's them

554
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,840
and their shitty comments.

555
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:19,240
And what were you saying?

556
00:29:19,530 --> 00:29:20,530
I wasn't paying attention.

557
00:29:20,630 --> 00:29:21,880
For fuck's sake...

558
00:29:22,770 --> 00:29:23,900
My question was:

559
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:25,230
What do you need my help with?

560
00:29:25,620 --> 00:29:26,720
So you're going to help me?

561
00:29:34,840 --> 00:29:36,030
Oh, hey.

562
00:29:36,650 --> 00:29:37,850
I got some news last night.

563
00:29:38,030 --> 00:29:38,560
What?

564
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:41,080
Kim packed up all his stuff
and left Sand's place.

565
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,130
Did he?

566
00:29:42,150 --> 00:29:42,840
Yeah.

567
00:29:42,980 --> 00:29:43,920
Serves him right, huh?

568
00:29:43,970 --> 00:29:45,010
Damn right.

569
00:29:45,030 --> 00:29:46,840
